  "notes": "{出費|しゅっぴ} refers to money spent or expenses incurred.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}がかさむ: expenses pile up\n- {予想外|よそうがい}の{出費|しゅっぴ}: unexpected expense\n- {大|おお}きな{出費|しゅっぴ}: major expense\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}を{抑|おさ}える: to keep expenses down\n- {出費|しゅっぴ}を{控|ひか}える: to cut back on spending\n\nUSAGE NOTES:\n- Neutral term for spending money\n- Often used when discussing budgets or financial planning",
